  "label": "Age-Appropriate Decision-Making",
  "description": "The societal understanding that children are not expected to make certain life decisions (like choosing their own bedtime or diet) because they lack the maturity or cognitive capacity to do so. This is contrasted with the meme's implication that gender identity is a 'choice' that requires more maturity, which is a false equivalence.",
